### Login como administrador
POST http://localhost:8085/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.tokenJWT); %}

### Consultar ViaCEP (API externa)
GET http://localhost:8085/enderecos/cep/01001000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar alunos
GET http://localhost:8085/alunos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar instrutores
GET http://localhost:8085/instrutores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar usuários - somente ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8085/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
